WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.180 --> 00:00:05.943
Mom opened the car door.

2
00:00:05.963 --> 00:00:09.385
"Cassie, meet Max.

3
00:00:32.812 --> 00:00:33.953
He's our new pet."

4
00:00:35.375 --> 00:00:38.438
Cassie grinned as a black dog ran toward her.

5
00:00:40.199 --> 00:00:43.042
The dog wagged his tail and licked her face.

6
00:00:44.003 --> 00:00:45.845
Then he jumped into her lap.

7
00:00:45.865 --> 00:00:50.389
"He likes you," Mom said.

8
00:00:50.409 --> 00:00:54.052
"I like him too," Cassie said.

9
00:00:54.072 --> 00:00:57.396
"I'm going to take him everywhere!"

10
00:00:59.936 --> 00:01:03.178
The next day Mom and Cassie took Max downtown.

11
00:01:12.002 --> 00:01:13.803
They went to the library first.

12
00:01:17.504 --> 00:01:20.266
"I'm sorry," the librarian said.

13
00:01:20.286 --> 00:01:24.568
"No dogs are allowed in the library."

14
00:01:31.196 --> 00:01:32.838
Next they went to the pharmacy.

15
00:01:41.446 --> 00:01:44.489
Cassie groaned when she saw the sign on the window.

16
00:01:44.509 --> 00:01:47.692
"No Dogs Allowed."

17
00:01:52.937 --> 00:01:55.500
After the pharmacy, they walked to the butcher shop.

18
00:02:03.276 --> 00:02:04.736
The butcher glared at them.

19
00:02:04.756 --> 00:02:08.237
"No dogs are allowed!"

20
00:02:08.618 --> 00:02:09.118
he said.

21
00:02:16.480 --> 00:02:20.341
While Mom bought some meat for dinner, Cassie waited outside.

22
00:02:20.361 --> 00:02:26.043
"I wanted to take you everywhere, Max," she said sadly.

23
00:02:26.063 --> 00:02:30.924
"But everyone says, 'No dogs are allowed!'"

24
00:02:34.276 --> 00:02:36.478
Max looked up and licked her face.

25
00:02:36.498 --> 00:02:42.641
"Let's walk home through the park," Mom said.

26
00:02:52.786 --> 00:02:55.428
Suddenly Max sniffed the air.

27
00:03:00.090 --> 00:03:03.212
think he wants us to follow him," Cassie said.

28
00:03:04.220 --> 00:03:05.801
Max ran through the park.

29
00:03:07.662 --> 00:03:09.342
Cassie heard loud barking.

30
00:03:13.724 --> 00:03:16.325
Then Max stopped near a tall fence.

31
00:03:24.789 --> 00:03:29.611
Cassie read the sign on the gate: Friendly Dogs Welcome.

32
00:03:29.631 --> 00:03:34.446
"Yay! It's a dog park!"

33
00:03:34.867 --> 00:03:35.488
she cried.

34
00:03:35.508 --> 00:03:37.870
"Dogs are welcome here!"

35
00:03:39.332 --> 00:03:41.755
She bent down to hug her new pet.

36
00:03:41.775 --> 00:03:45.420
"I guess I can't take you everywhere, Max.

37
00:03:46.341 --> 00:03:48.744
But we can always come here together!"

38
00:03:48.764 --> 00:03:52.148
"Woof!" Max barked happily.
